如果我们需要监听某个元素是否出现在视口中，一般做法是监听 scroll 事件，然后查询元素离视口顶部的距离，但是监听 scroll 事件存在性能问题。 浏览器原生提供了 IntersectionObserver 监听器，可以监听某个元素是否出现在视口中。 使用方法 首先通过 new IntersectionObserver(callback, options) 创建一个监视器，其中 callback 是当监听的元素出现在视口时执行的回调函数， options 是一些选项，稍后介绍。 然后通过监视器的 observe 方法监听感兴趣的元素。 :::tau-node{type="tabs"} {"type":"tabs","tauContract":"0256f72bf503014a7ea32d073aa02da06da7e88c98797870e4d49fa627404693","collabId":"191ba7c1-a510-44b4-a7ed-235f2c52e092","children":[{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"472f54b4-f245-4adf-a29b-2eaeacfb794d","title":"HTML","tauContract":"fcfba932818e04e88c2c071bc4f973b1244251a453f417037be7051a453b8f66","collabId":"0745be7d-31bf-4da9-97dd-b0ca97274362","children":[{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"e33d82e0-d31f-4e74-8eaa-982d30dd3e47","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6eac6ca3-69ad-4a49-92a3-0f5df73b6175","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<div id="box"></div>","collabId":"f8e6a5db-7f13-477b-892c-c52d58d62349","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"ca5f45ad-a5f0-4c75-b3e2-ea7c8e20403b","title":"CSS","tauContract":"fcfba932818e04e88c2c071bc4f973b1244251a453f417037be7051a453b8f66","collabId":"9df76442-4a04-415c-b1fc-6dfab7f6e3af","children":[{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"9ed48f92-87bc-4e02-8415-76591f013213","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"189cd483-cd8e-458d-8ac9-ba7efe3c576f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"#box {
